  "term": "equal opportunity",
  "definition": "Equal opportunity refers to a setting in which people have comparable chances to enter, advance, and achieve regardless of gender. In the source context, a field may appear balanced in overall participation yet still fail to provide equal opportunity if women remain underrepresented in senior roles or their professional advancement does not match their contributions.",
